      "en": "When he had spent three months there, and a plot was made against him by Jews as he was about to set sail for Syria, he determined to return through Macedonia.",
      "ko": "거기 석 달을 있다가 배 타고 수리아로 가고자 할 그 때에 유대인들이 자기를 해하려고 공모하므로 마게도냐로 다녀 돌아가기를 작정하니",
      "source_text_hash": "60bb7f8fedcee7d2874e596f385d97841f087f3aa9914068973a4978c418dbcf",
      "translation_text_hash": "fdcd44178b0fbda7d85e4c35ebc1860c489f33ee82689f01438a4d7ab279285f",
