      "en": "But these had gone ahead, and were waiting for us at Troas.",
      "ko": "그들은 먼저 가서 드로아에서 우리를 기다리더라",
      "source_text_hash": "79783442295203a21486f319a168e50842c0090edefba74dcd19c46ee6119ee4",
      "translation_text_hash": "27c5d3747398163222c28623b2148d721b31338483e462d050a70c84da4b2a04",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
