      "en": "On the first day of the week, when the disciples were gathered together to break bread, Paul talked with them, intending to depart on the next day; and continued his speech until midnight.",
      "ko": "안식 후 첫날에 우리가 떡을 떼려 하여 모였더니 바울이 이튿날 떠나고자 하여 저희에게 강론할쌔 말을 밤중까지 계속하매",
      "source_text_hash": "29b626b26bf799ed76eb0b737628bdab2e85b0748b2ed6a651fe78017af4c15e",
      "translation_text_hash": "7f3310093f1df3bbdbafba58a58b24975b806e4a6a340b8535e061ccf22c87f4",
