      "en": "A certain young man named Eutychus sat in the window, weighed down with deep sleep. As Paul spoke still longer, being weighed down by his sleep, he fell down from the third floor and was taken up dead.",
      "ko": "유두고라 하는 청년이 창에 걸터 앉았다가 깊이 졸더니 바울이 강론하기를 더 오래 하매 졸음을 이기지 못하여 삼 층 누에서 떨어지거늘 일으켜 보니 죽었는지라",
      "source_text_hash": "56d19ccd2828d90334119b522167e54e0f6c990d9a7cb708f6c2fa28f517368b",
      "translation_text_hash": "c26dde0e579d13b548d88f84b7560c37c0c684ada9238616b256ae9ded6c23d3",
