      "en": "When they had come to him, he said to them, “You yourselves know, from the first day that I set foot in Asia, how I was with you all the time,",
      "ko": "오매 저희에게 말하되 아시아에 들어온 첫날부터 지금까지 내가 항상 너희 가운데서 어떻게 행한 것을 너희도 아는바니",
      "source_text_hash": "caa36907c030eda679db25c770b2aad3ab4868c902d300955864416fca7d9094",
      "translation_text_hash": "484b53bb652e571b60d8178a7f1d1f243bb9e4c1616dfd0e223bcbc7e029b49d",
